{
  "name": "多來源 API 整合與工程師笑話電子報自動發信",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤣 多 API 整合與幽默笑話電子報\n\n1. **Schedule Trigger**：每週五下午或每日定時排程啟動。\n2. **HTTP Request 1 & 2**：分別抓取「名人名言」與「程式設計師幽默笑話」。\n3. **Edit Fields (Set)**：聚合多來源資料，提取名言、作者與笑話問答內容。\n4. **Gmail**：排版為精美雙卡片 HTML 郵件，自動寄送給團隊放鬆心情！",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-joke-overview",
      "name": "流程總覽說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 17,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        140
      ],
      "id": "schedule-joke-trigger",
      "name": "每週五下午 17:00 定時觸發"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://zenquotes.io/api/random",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        140
      ],
      "id": "http-fetch-quote",
      "name": "取得名人引言"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://v2.jokeapi.dev/joke/Programming?blacklistFlags=nsfw,religious,political,racist,sexist,explicit&type=single",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        140
      ],
      "id": "http-fetch-joke",
      "name": "取得程式設計師笑話"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-quote-author",
              "name": "quoteAuthor",
              "value": "={{ $('取得名人引言').item.json[0].a || $('取得名人引言').item.json.a }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-quote-text",
              "name": "quoteText",
              "value": "={{ $('取得名人引言').item.json[0].q || $('取得名人引言').item.json.q }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-joke",
              "name": "jokeContent",
              "value": "={{ $json.joke }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-category",
              "name": "jokeCategory",
              "value": "={{ $json.category }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-date",
              "name": "sendDate",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        140
      ],
      "id": "set-aggregate-data",
      "name": "聚合引言與笑話資料"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "YOUR_EMAIL@gmail.com",
        "subject": "=🎉 【週末放鬆特刊】{{ $json.sendDate }} 工程師幽默笑話與心靈金句",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; background-color: #f8fafc;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;\">💻 工程師週末放鬆特刊 ☕</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;\">辛苦了一週，笑一笑準備迎接美好假期！</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 笑話卡片 -->\n  <div style=\"background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 5px solid #10b981; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <span style=\"background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;\">😂 工程師笑話 ({{ $json.jokeCategory }})</span>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; margin: 12px 0 0 0;\">\n      {{ $json.jokeContent }}\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 金句卡片 -->\n  <div style=\"background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 5px solid #8b5cf6; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <span style=\"background: #ede9fe; color: #5b21b6; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;\">✨ 今日金句</span>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; font-style: italic; margin: 12px 0 6px 0;\">\n      “{{ $json.quoteText }}”\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: right; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; margin: 0;\">\n      —— {{ $json.quoteAuthor }}\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        140
      ],
      "id": "gmail-send-joke-mail",
      "name": "Gmail 發送幽默電子報",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "YOUR_GMAIL_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
